# Product intent

This app tracks a living visual collection from screenshots. If two screenshots look different, they are different specimens. Keep both.

Do not model this as "one Pokemon belongs to one category". One upload may fill several dex tracks at once.

Collector goal: unique looks (species, form, shiny, costume, shadow/purified, background). IV 0 and IV 100 are stat tracks, not visual uniqueness.

Never add a Pin / favorite-cover lock. The only cover control is `Set as cover`.